  "name": null,
  "problem": "The growth rate of the number of households $P(t)$ participating in a neighborhood composting program is jointly proportional to the number of participating households at time $t,$ measured in years, and the difference between the program’s carrying capacity and the number of participating households. The constant of proportionality is $0.0005$ and the carrying capacity is $800.$\n\nHow many households will be participating after $7$ years given that there were $100$ households participating initially? Round your answer to the nearest integer.\n\nAfter $7$ years, there will be approximately \n{{field-1}} households participating in the program.",
